NeuroSync Figma Mock-up

The Figma mock-up is a visual prototype of NeuroSync that demonstrates how the platform is intended to look and work. 
It showcases the proposed layout, dashboards, key features and user navigation. The mock-up is used to communicate the concept and design before full implementation. 
Some screens and features may be visual representations only and may not yet be fully functional or connected to live data.

